 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.12-rc31 — One app: UWX sections in the sidebar
+
+- Everything UnderWeb X does now has its own spot in the left sidebar, alongside the VRCX features, instead of being tucked into tabs inside one page:
+  - Overview, Invites, People & Activity
+  - Group Tools, Group Intelligence, Moderation Center
+  - Staff Dashboard, Approvals
+  - Safety Intel, Chatbox (OSC), UWX Settings
+- The VRCX features are grouped underneath:
+  - **Social:** Feed, Friends Locations, Friends List, Friend Log, VRChat moderation
+  - **Instances:** Player List, Game Log, Instance Activity
+  - **Favorites** and **Charts**, plus Search, Notifications, My Avatars and Tools
+- Staff-only sections only appear for people whose VRChat group role or UnderWeb role allows them.
+- The sidebar is reset to this layout once on update. You can still rearrange it in the sidebar's edit mode afterwards.
+
 ## 0.6.11-rc30 — Hub check-ins & Silk
 
 - **Hub check-in:** spend 10 minutes in the UnderWeb hub with UWX open and you're checked in for the day. Only your own visit is sent — never who else is there or which instance.
